; MW1: Critical Hit's Bar (src/mw1_bar_screen.h), on MW1's screen template
; (src/mw1_screen.h; ANCHOR, LABEL_AT, LABEL_FONT, LABEL_OFF_FONT, TEXTS and
; the _WIDE layout are ours). FIXES.md item 3, CATALOG's 5, 13 and 15: the bar
; scene, three pages in one layout (the screen shows each page's pieces):
; - the Bar: MW1's menu at the lower right (ORDER DRINK, NEWS, RECRUIT CREW,
;   YOUR LANCE, LEAVE);
; - RECRUIT CREW, the interview: the recruit's portrait framed, the record
;   and their words on the terminal; HIRE, PREV, NEXT, DONE down the left
;   (FIXES.md item 68: no DECLINE);
; - YOUR LANCE, MW1's crew grid: a column each for you and the lancemates
;   (the portrait, the rows, the mech's picture), the chosen one's frame lit;
;   FIRE, PREV, NEXT, DONE down the left (FIXES 69: no ASSIGN; the mech
;   lab assigns).
; The plaques: the world and its House; the place and the company's funds.
; All MW1's own art (mw1image.zbd): nothing of Pirate's Moon's (FIXES.md item
; 5; tests/test_mw1_look.cpp). The portraits and mechs are named per view.
;
; MW1BARDIALOG is 4:3's (640); MW1BARDIALOG_WIDE the 16:9 canvas's (853).
(
MW1BARDIALOG (
  CURSOR (BITMAP ("mw1_cursor") CENTER (1))
  PRIMITIVES (
